		elizaos/eliza-1-training-data


Training corpus for the eliza-1 model line. All records are in eliza_native_v1 format — the canonical training schema for elizaOS agents.



		Format


Every record is a JSON object with this shape:
{
  "format": "eliza_native_v1",
  "boundary": "vercel_ai_sdk.generateText",
  "request": {
    "system": "...",
    "messages": [...],
    "tools": {...},
    "settings": {}
  },
  "response": {
    "text": "...",
    "finishReason": "stop"… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/elizaos/eliza-1-training-data.



		s1K-1.1 Oracle Reasoning Traces from Qwen3-235B-A22B


Oracle reasoning traces for s1K-1.1 questions, generated by qwen3-235b-a22b via OpenRouter under clean inference (no prompt-injection attack).



		Schema


ShareGPT 2-message format:
{"messages": [
  {"role": "user", "content": "<question>"},
  {"role": "assistant", "content": "<think>...reasoning...</think>\n<final answer>"}
]}

